# N.B.: In this CIF, the methylammonium cation (CH3NH3+) is modelled as C and N superimposed on each other, i.e.: with an occupany of 0.5.  We have found that even with the methylammonium cation removed, we can still fit the PXRD pattern just as well.  We do not expect the methylammonium cation to significantly the intensity of the diffraction peaks.
